[[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a lift.</p><p>Disconnect the battery negative terminal.</p><p><a href=\"#/2753303\">7055A42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752829\">4450B12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753309\">7055B90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753310\">7055B91</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753353\">7210E10</a></p><p>1. Disconnect the electrical connection for the light cluster.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>F10</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>F11</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p>2. Undo the retaining bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the lights cluster.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2046963.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[7,1,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Position the light cluster\nin its seating and tighten the fixing bolts.</p><p>Connect the light cluster electrical connection.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Left headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>F10</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001294.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Right headlamp</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><strong>F11</strong></p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2753353\">7210E10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753310\">7055B91</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753309\">7055B90</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2752829\">4450B12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2753303\">7055A42</a></p><p>Connect the battery negative terminal.</p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"]]